--- A variable named like web's form (`bytes`, web not imported) is indexed
--- as the program's own, and one named like another language's keyword
--- (`match`) is read and written by position, inside an interpolation too:
--- both had been refused, the keyword's lesson placed at line 1 of the
--- file (Rosetta Code, Bitcoin address validation, Blossom algorithm).
bytes = [1, 2]
log[bytes[0]]

match = [1, 2]
match[0] = 5
log[match]
log['`match[0]`']
